  "lb\tfenghaoran-q002\tI remember visiting a friend in Shenzhen at the beginning of the year. He took me to see their company's exhibition hall, and in the café downstairs he demonstrated an investment dashboard using Excel and some framework—what was it? He also ran a long piece of code at the time, and I took a photo of the screen with my phone, but I can't find it.": {
