    "cost": 0.0005415,
    "in": 5295
  },
  "lb\tfenghaoran-q032\tWhen Zhou Jianhua was handing over clients to me, he mentioned how far Huang Siqi's company financing had progressed. He also suggested something I should pay attention to when communicating with her—what was it again?": {
    "order": [0, 1, 8, 5],
    "raw": "{\"records\": [0, 1, 8, 5]}",
    "stop": "end_turn",
    "ms": 898,
    "cost": 0.0005426000000000001,
    "in": 5336
  },
  "lb\tfenghaoran-q041\tI remember that meeting with the investment director. He mentioned the time requirement for the exam, saying that I had to pass CFA Level I by a certain date. What was the exact deadline? I'm quite impressed by it, but I can't remember the date.": {
    "order": [8, 23, 28, 7],
