    "cost": 0.0005417,
    "in": 5327
  },
  "lb\tfenghaoran-q036\tIn early May, I met a friend near Lushan South Road to discuss plans for doing self-media. At the time, we set the frequency of posting videos every week, but I forgot which day of the week it was updated. Can you help me recall?": {
