  "lb\tfenghaoran-q073\tI experienced a few special things this year. Can you help me put them in chronological order?\n1. Created a column called \"Yuelu Finance Talk\", launched simultaneously on WeChat and Zhihu, using a morning mist photo of Aiwan Pavilion on Yuelu Mountain as the header image.\n2. Had a video call with my friend Xie Yutong in Shenzhen, apologized for canceling the camping last time, and also arranged to try camping in May.\n3. Deep into the night, I fine-tuned wedding photos, adjusting exposure and color temperature, working until midnight.\n4. Successfully completed a V3 route at V-Power Climbing Gym, and the coach praised me (that morning I had just accompanied my parents for a physical examination at Xiangya Hospital).\n5. Went to Hengshan to take photos. After returning home, I imported them into Lightroom for fine editing and made an electronic album called \"One Day at Hengshan and the Cloud Stone Book\".\n6. My photos of the Changsha Marathon were adopted by the official Weibo account, which also @me, and the readership quickly exceeded 10,000.\n\nWhich of these happened first, and which happened later?": {
